"The Secret of the Flying Dutchman is the thirteenth issue of the Huntik Magazine comic book series and the first issue in the second series of comics.\n\nSynopsis\n\nThe Organization, led by the sinister Diaz and the scheming Snake, pursue the Huntik team in a fight to recover the amulet of the spooky titan, Ghostfog.","raw_wikitext":"{{Infobox comic\n|image = File:HM13 cover.jpeg\n|issue = 13\n|released = November 2010\n|italian = Il segreto dell'Olandese Volante\n|writer = [[Michelangelo La Neve]]\n|previous = [[The Lost City of Casterwill]]\n|next = [[Cerberus (Comic)|Cerberus]]\n|director = [[Iginio Straffi]]\n|new locations = [[Flying Dutchman]]\n|new characters = [[Diaz]] <br> [[Snake]]\n|new titans = [[Ghostfog]]}}\n\n'''The Secret of the Flying Dutchman''' is the thirteenth issue of the ''[[Huntik Magazine]]'' comic book series and the first issue in the second series of comics.\n\n== Synopsis ==\n[[The Organization]], led by the sinister [[Diaz]] and the scheming [[Snake]], pursue the Huntik team in a fight to recover the amulet of the spooky titan, [[Ghostfog]].\n[[Category:Comics| 13]]{{Clear}}{{ComicsNav}}","categories":["Comics"],"links":[{"target_title":"Michelangelo La Neve","label":"Michelangelo La Neve","target_id":null,"target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Michelangelo_La_Neve","status":"unresolved"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:10431","status":"resolved","target_title":"The Lost City of Casterwill","label":"The Lost City of Casterwill","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/The_Lost_City_of_Casterwill","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A10431"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:12952","status":"resolved","target_title":"Cerberus (Comic)","label":"Cerberus","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Cerberus_%28Comic%29","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A12952"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:2279","status":"resolved","target_title":"Iginio Straffi","label":"Iginio Straffi","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Iginio_Straffi","href":"#/entry/hun